{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID: 40709562（步态启动期 STN-LFP 与后续步态冻结研究）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40709562\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告第2.3节称，该研究主要分析没有实际冻结发生的步态启动试次，因此更接近FOG易感性证据，而不是实际冻结期间的直接神经活动证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"该研究纳入38名帕金森病患者，其中12名在实验中观察到FOG，共有99个包含冻结事件的步行试次和263次冻结事件。首次冻结平均发生在步态启动后约8步。因此，步态启动期的STN-LFP不仅反映一般FOG易感性，还包含随后发生实际冻结的试次所提供的冻结前事件关联信息。虽然它不是实际冻结期间的LFP记录，但应归类为Pre-FOG证据，而不能主要归为一般FOG susceptibility证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID: 41741462（长期自适应DBS与FOG-Q改善研究）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41741462\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"结构化附录中该研究的evidence记录称：本研究报告aDBS较cDBS具有额外的运动症状改善，但没有明确报告FOG改善。该记录的依据标记为abstract。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始论文全文明确报告，5名长期接受aDBS的患者在优化后FOG-Q评分平均改善40%。因此，不能说研究没有报告FOG改善。准确的表述应是：问卷指标出现探索性改善，但样本仅有5人，缺乏充分的统计推断；日常生活可穿戴设备记录的冻结事件仅在2/5患者中减少，其他患者的变化存在明显差异。因此，这属于有初步问卷改善信号、但客观日常冻结事件结果异质且证据不足的研究。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "275187f3-f81a-45ea-8fd6-707adf76e3bc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104358881744Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:44:18.750927+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55d32641fc9da6cac56579c2fc8b45d4fc19c1fa3a64b8e4585634e26135aec1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104358881744Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3136dcb943b3fb9c71c89f76a2b64273fe5d7d216e17d4f84a9f5e0e45fd4d54"}}}
